  "confidence_score": 18,
  "overall_critique": "This forecast rests on three simultaneously fragile pillars \u2014 subsidiary-led revenue recovery, provisioning normalisation, and implicit going-concern continuity \u2014 each of which is highly uncertain given IFCI's structurally impaired balance sheet, negative regulatory capital, and absence of fresh lending capacity. The 10% annual revenue growth assumption is particularly optimistic and insufficiently supported by evidence that subsidiary income can offset core lending decay, making the projected loss-narrowing trajectory more aspirational than analytically grounded."
